{"availability":"available","full":"agents-universe/agents-universe","name":"agents-universe","description":"不是问答机器人，而是能真正干活的数字分身。共享智能体，共享项目上下文，让项目所有成员一起协同工作。同时智能体会像人一样通过资料或者工作抽象和总结经验到项目上下文中","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":660,"forks":2,"created":"2026-09-10T12:45:40Z","updated":"2026-10-18T13:22:45Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://agent.agents-universe.com/","topics":["agent","agent-framework","agent-orchestration","agent-skill","agentic-ai","ai-agents","ai-governance","ai-tools","deepseek-harness","harness","harness-engineering","harness-framework","python","python3","vue3","vuejs","web-application","webapp","workbuddy","workbuddy-alternative"],"demo":"https://agents-universe.com/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T22:44:17.443Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T22:44:17.443Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T22:44:17.443Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-05T19:06:41.636Z","stars":457,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-07T20:11:54.451Z","stars":493,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-08T13:01:17.458Z","stars":498,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-10T21:03:33.961Z","stars":542,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-16T21:34:30.914Z","stars":628,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-18T22:44:17.443Z","stars":660,"forks":2}],"technologies":["Vue","Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Agents Universe 是一个开源（Apache-2.0）的企业级 AI Agent 平台。它不是又一个\"更聪明的聊天框\"，而是要让智能体真正成为能干活的人：入职读懂文档、接任务先规划、以个人身份与权限执行、留下可审计的轨迹，并把这一切沉淀为每个人都能复用、共同建设的资产。","Codex 式三栏界面：左侧会话与项目导航，中间对话流，右侧计划与知识上下文（点击可查看大图）","### 🚀 它正在管理它自己 本项目已部署在 agents-universe.com，并且正在被它自己管理。 平台上的 Product Owner 与 Tech Lead 智能体，就是这个仓库的日常维护者：需求、代码、PR 都由智能体们在对话中完成。 因此——给这个项目做贡献，不需要会写代码。注册账号、配置你自己的模型 API Key 与 Git Token，然后和 Product Owner 聊需求，聊得差不多 @Tech Lead 告诉它要实现哪个，即可完成协作提交 PR。详见 零代码共建。"],"features":["是什么 — 开源企业级 AI Agent 平台：多 LLM 统一接入、10 个开箱即用的智能体、Docker 一键自托管。详见核心特性","解决什么 — 智能体的两极困局：开发者框架门槛高、经验不可传承；低代码平台没有身份、权限与可审计轨迹。详见为什么是 Agents Universe","有何不同 — 像人一样学习与工作：入职读文档（全量加载，无向量检索）、按计划与身份执行、经验沉淀为可复制的技能/工作流/知识资产。详见智能体是如何学习的"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/agents-universe/agents-universe/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"89b99fbfe65669b4c29e9c6c6642f1467b6573c93006f051afd7c768b74a75fd","extractedAt":"2026-10-16T21:34:31.080Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T22:44:17.551Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Agents Universe 是一个开源（Apache-2.0）的企业级 AI Agent 平台。它不是又一个\"更聪明的聊天框\"，而是要让智能体真正成为能干活的人：入职读懂文档、接任务先规划、以个人身份与权限执行、留下可审计的轨迹，并把这一切沉淀为每个人都能复用、共同建设的资产。","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/agents-universe/agents-universe/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"89b99fbfe65669b4c29e9c6c6642f1467b6573c93006f051afd7c768b74a75fd","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/agents-universe/agents-universe/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-18T22:44:17.552Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-18T13:22:45Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/agents-universe/agents-universe/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-18T22:44:17.555Z","hash":"89b99fbfe65669b4c29e9c6c6642f1467b6573c93006f051afd7c768b74a75fd","originalBytes":45167,"storedBytes":45167,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T22:44:17.443Z","demoHealth":{"url":"https://agents-universe.com/","attemptedAt":"2026-10-18T23:04:41.411Z","probeVersion":3,"status":"working","checkedAt":"2026-10-18T23:04:41.411Z","lastWorkingAt":"2026-10-18T23:04:41.411Z","target":"https://login.agents-universe.com/login/oauth/authorize?response_type=code&client_id=64c98466c1c475926143&redirect_uri=https%3A%2F%2Fagent.agents-universe.com%2Fauth%2Fcallback&scope=openid+profile+email&state=46cea759-6101-4867-a66c-2a4f0f3ef99b","failureCount":0,"consecutiveTemporaryFailures":0,"nextCheckAt":"2026-10-25T23:04:41.411Z"},"previewAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T23:04:41.411Z","previewCheck":{"url":"https://agents-universe.com/","attemptedAt":"2026-10-18T23:04:41.411Z","consecutiveFailures":0,"status":"captured","reason":null,"nextCheckAt":"2026-10-25T23:04:4